  "articleBody": "Finish carpentry is what truly elevates a room, turning a house into a home by adding those crucial aesthetic details. It encompasses everything from the foundational trim and baseboards to intricate casing around doors and windows, and elegant crown molding. You might also be thinking about custom built-ins that maximize space and add character. The goal of finish carpentry is to achieve a seamless, high-quality look, so pieces should fit together tightly with consistent reveals. Expect a paint-ready finish, meaning all nail holes are filled, joints are caulked smoothly, and surfaces are properly sanded. This process often starts with meticulous measuring and planning, followed by careful material selection, precise cuts, and expert fastening. HH Remodeling LLC focuses on these details to ensure a flawless final appearance. When done right, finish carpentry isn't just about installation; it's about crafting an integral part of your home's appeal.",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
}